..
.. Ablauf         : Unterprogramm fÅr FOP.137.BUBESCHR u. Infosystem EDIREF
..
.. Functionality  : Definition of lables for "VDA" delivery schedule forecasts
..                  and JIT delivery schedule
..
.. Interface (arguments and their meaning)
..   uses array argument (arg.i)           : no
..   uses name argument  (xpname=value)    : no
..
.. Program flow   : called from FOP.137.BUBESCHR and infosystem EDIREF
